flowchart TB
    Start["啟動安全測試／先保留 BLOCK 證據<br/>Start run / early blocking evidence"] --> Parent["登記擁有者與群組／握手後執行<br/>Durable registration before worker release"]
    Parent --> Config["核對 RoE／政策／來源摘要<br/>Validate scope, policy and source digests"]
    Config --> G1["G1：PyPI／鎖定檔 SBOM／OSV<br/>Pinned provenance and exact-version SCA"]
    G1 --> G2["G2：Gitleaks／工作樹與自身 HEAD 歷史<br/>Gitleaks / worktree and own HEAD history"]
    G2 --> Ready{"掃描完整且零 findings？<br/>Complete and clean scans?"}
    Ready -->|"是 / Yes"| Runtime["啟動無網路 app／DB，評估前核對隔離設定<br/>Isolated containers verified before evaluation"]
    Ready -->|"否 / No"| Skip["AUTH 不執行，保留缺口<br/>NOT_RUN with failure evidence"]
    Runtime --> Auth["外部 oracle：44 案例／完整回應與 DB 狀態<br/>44 exact authorization and side-effect checks"]
    Auth --> Pending["重查摘要／等待清理<br/>Recheck digests / AWAITING_CLEANUP"]
    Skip --> Pending
    Config -->|"錯誤 / Error"| Error["保留錯誤／BLOCK<br/>Fail closed with evidence"]
    Runtime -->|"隔離失敗 / Isolation failure"| Error
    Parent -->|"取消／逾時 / Cancel or timeout"| Error
    Pending --> Cleanup["父程序清理群組／容器／目錄<br/>Parent verifies all owned resources removed"]
    Error --> Cleanup
    Recovery["擁有者死亡後 janitor 回收<br/>Dead-owner recovery with PID / boot identity"] -.-> Cleanup
    Cleanup --> Eligible{"必要 gates／證據／清理皆完整？<br/>All required contracts satisfied?"}
    Eligible -->|"是 / Yes"| Allow["ALLOW／回傳碼 0<br/>Accepted within this synthetic scope"]
    Eligible -->|"否 / No"| Block["BLOCK／回傳碼 1<br/>Retain recovery state on cleanup failure"]
    Allow --> Report["schema 3 報告／本機未簽章<br/>Run-bound local evidence"]
    Block --> Report
